{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01095","headline":"相和歌辞 王昭君二首 一 · 李白","name":"相和歌辞 王昭君二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家秦地月，流影照明妃。\n一上玉关道，天涯去不归。\n汉月还从东海出，明妃西嫁无来日。\n燕支长寒雪作花，蛾眉顦顇没胡沙。\n生乏黄金枉图画，死留青冢使人嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}